<title>CANADA: Saskatchewan Agriculture details crop progress.</title>
<headline>Saskatchewan Agriculture details crop progress.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saskatchewan Agriculture on Thursday detailed the level of crop progress to June 29.</p>
<p>CEREALS  PRE-EMERG EMERGED TILLERED JOINTED SHOTBLADE HEADED</p>
<p>June 29   0 pct     2 pct   26 pct   47 pct  23 pct    2 pct</p>
<p>92/96 AVG 0 pct     5 pct   44 pct   37 pct  13 pct    1 pct</p>
<p>CANOLA   PRE-EMERG EMERGED SEEDLING ROSETTE FLOWERING PODDING</p>
<p>June 29   0 pct     2 pct   23 pct   57 pct  18 pct    0 pct</p>
<p>92/96 AVG 1 pct     8 pct   41 pct   44 pct   7 pct    0 pct</p>
<p>FLAX     PRE-EMERG EMERGED SEEDLING TILLERED FLOWERING</p>
<p>June 29   1 pct     4 pct   38 pct   56 pct   1 pct</p>
<p>92/96 AVG 1 pct     9 pct   54 pct   37 pct   0 pct</p>
<p>PULSES   PRE-EMERG EMERGED VEGETATE FLOWERED PODDING</p>
<p>June 29   0 pct     3 pct   85 pct   11 pct   1 pct</p>
<p>July 1/96 0 pct    11 pct   86 pct    3 pct   0 pct</p>
<p>FALL CRP TILLERED  JOINTED SHOTBLADE HEADED  DOUGH</p>
<p>June 29   0 pct     1 pct    6 pct   55 pct  38 pct</p>
<p>92/96 AVG 0 pct     2 pct    8 pct   66 pct  25 pct</p>
<p>((Gilbert Le Gras, Winnipeg Reuters bureau 204 947 3548))</p>
